:: Pub Dice Minigame Intro
<<effects>>
<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>>

You approach a table of rough-looking <<group>> loadly playing dice, overtly dissing and goading each other. You see the <<person2>><<person>> shoot <<his>> dice with a silent prayer, only to watch <<him>> curse out loud as the rest of the group sparks into celebration upon having won that round.
<br><br>

The <<person1>><<person>> turns around to face you, eyeing you up and down. An implied hunger in <<his>> gaze. <br>
"Looking to play, or are you just gonna watch?" 
<br><br>

<<link [[Looking to play|Pub Dice Minigame Intro 2]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Pub]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Pub Dice Minigame Intro 2
<<effects>><<set $phase to 1>><<set $diceintro to 1>>

"Is that so?" <<he>> flashes a cocky smile. "Hear that, folks? I think we fancy ourselves a new player over here." The <<group>> laugh heartily as the <<person1>><<person>> motions you to a chair. You sit.
<br><br>

"So..." the <<person>> leans forwards on the table. "Are you a high-roller, or are you a little <<bitch>>?" The <<group>> mock you overtly, thinking you're just some drunken waif. 
<br><br>

"Just so you know," <<he>> continues. "you'll need at least <<printmoney 50000>> to play with us."
<br><br>

<<if $money gte 50000>>
	<<link [[Play (£500)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>><<set $wagerLvl to 0>><<set $money -= 50000>><<set $diceintro to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money gte 100000>>
	<<link [[Play (£1000)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>><<set $wagerLvl to 1>><<set $money -= 100000>><<set $diceintro to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money gte 300000>>
	<<link [[Play (£3000)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>><<set $wagerLvl to 2>><<set $money -= 300000>><<set $diceintro to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money lt 50000>>
	You don't have enough cash.
<</if>>

<br>
<<link [[Back out|Pub]]>><</link>>

:: Pub Dice Minigame Widgets [widget]

	<<widget "dice-log">>
		<<for $dice.log.length gt 0>>
			<<print $dice.log.shift()>><br>
		<</for>>
		<br>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-events">>
		<<if $dice.event.pending is 0>>
			<<if $dice.event.drinkIntro is 1>>
				After the last few rounds, the <<group>> have gotten fired up enough already and have decided to up the stakes further by introducing penalties. Regardless of your opinion, you'd still be outvoted. <span class="purple">Losers must now drink as a penalty.</span><br><br>
				<<set $dice.event.diceIntro to 2>>
				<<set $dice.event.drinkEnabled to 1>>
			<</if>>
			<<set _text_output to "The <<people>> are goading each other, and just being rowdy overall.">>
			<<print _text_output>>
		<<else>>
			<<if $dice.event.drinkEnabled>>
				After taking tally of who lost and who won, an spectator picks what seems like a random bottle and begins serving shots. Each one from a different bottle, three shots are placed on a tray out of sight, and offered to the losers in order.
				<br><br>
				<<set _shotsRemaining to 3>><<rng 1 3>>
				<<for _i to 1; _i lte 3; _i++>>
					<<if $dice.event.roundLoss[_i]>>
						Having lost the previous round, the <<= "<<person"+_i+">>">><<person>> picks a glass and <<= either("downs", "drinks", "gulps")>> <<his>> shot.
						<<set _shotsRemaining-->>
					<<else>>
						The <<= "<<person"+_i+">>">><<person>> rejoices, as <<hes>> managed to win the previous round.
					<</if>>
					<br>
				<</for>>
				<br>
				<<if $dice.event.roundLoss[0]>>
					It is now your turn to pick your glass, and down your shot.
					<br><br>
					<<for _i to 1; _i lte _shotsRemaining; _i++>>
						<<capture _i, $rng>>
							<<link [[Pick shot #_i|Pub Dice Minigame]]>>
								<<if $rng is _i and !playerIsXChanged()>>
									<<xchange-random-spike>>
									<<run $dice.log.push('You\'ve changed. <span class="purple">There was something in your drink.</span>')>>
									<<set _comment to either(
										"To be honest, you look much better like this.",
										$player.sex is "f"? "Looking pretty cute, ehh?":"Looking quite handsome, ehh?",
										"I was thinking we needed some eye candy.",
										"Things are getting quite interesting now.",
										"Oh yes, that's a fine piece of ass indeed."
									)>>
									<<run $dice.log.push('"Gahahaha!" the <<person1>><<person>> laughs. "'+_comment+'"')>>
								<</if>>
								<<alcohol either(30,30,30,60,60,120,180)>>
							<</link>><br>
						<</capture>>
					<</for>>
				<<else>>
					<<link [[Next|Pub Dice Minigame]]>><</link>>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-display">>
		<table class="dice-grid">
			<thead>
				<tr>
					<th scope="col"></th>
					<th scope="col" class="text-center">You</th>
					<th scope="col" class="text-center"><<silently>><<person1>><<person>><</silently>><<capitalise>></th>
					<th scope="col" class="text-center"><<silently>><<person2>><<person>><</silently>><<capitalise>></th>
					<th scope="col" class="text-center"><<silently>><<person3>><<person>><</silently>><<capitalise>></th>
				</tr>
			</thead>
			<tbody>
				<tr>
					<th scope="row">Money</th>
					<<for _money range $dice.money>>
						<td class="text-right"><<printmoney _money>></td>
					<</for>>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<th scope="row">Current Bet</th>
					<<for _bet range $dice.bets>>
						<td class="text-right"><<printmoney _bet>></td>
					<</for>>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<th scope="row">Position</th>
					<<for _position range $dice.positions>>
						<td class="text-right"><span class="gold">_position</span></td>
					<</for>>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<th score="row" class="dice-pot">Winners' Pot</th>
					<td colspan="4" class="text-center dice-pot"><b><<printmoney $dice.pot>></b></td>
				</tr>
			</tbody>
		</table>
		<br>

		<<if $phase gt 1>>
			<<if $dice.round.point>>
				<b><span class="dice-point"><span class="gold">The Point:</span> $dice.round.point</span></b>
				<br><br>
			<</if>>

			<<if $dice.values>>
				<img @src="'img/misc/die_'+$dice.values[0]+'.png'">
				<img @src="'img/misc/die_'+$dice.values[1]+'.png'">
			<<else>>
				<img src="img/misc/die_roll.gif">
				<img src="img/misc/die_roll.gif">
			<</if>>

			<<if $dice.values>>
				<<set _diceResult to $dice.values[0]+$dice.values[1]>>
				<span class="dice-result-text"><b> = _diceResult</b></span>
			<</if>>


			<<if $dice.shooter is 0 and $dice.round.result is "In Favour">>
				<span class="dice-result-text"><b> | <span class="green">You win!</span></b></span>
			<<elseif $dice.shooter is 0 and $dice.round.result is "Against">>
				<span class="dice-result-text"><b> | <span class="red">You lose...</span></b></span>
			<<elseif $dice.round.result and $dice.positions[0] is $dice.round.result>>
				<span class="dice-result-text"><b> | <span class="green">You win!</span></b></span>
			<<elseif $dice.round.result and $dice.positions[0] isnot $dice.round.result>>
				<span class="dice-result-text"><b> | <span class="red">You lose...</span></b></span>
			<</if>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-betting-interface">>
		<table>
			<tbody>
			<tr>
				<th class="gold"><<if $dice.shooter is 0>>Amount to wager<<else>>Raise the bet<</if>> (£):</th>
				<td>
					<<numberbox "_bet" 0>> 
					<mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>
					<<if $dice.shooter is 0>>
						Increases the current bet by this amount.
					<<else>>
						Increase the current bet by this amount, after matching the amount wagered by the rest of players.
					<</if>>
					</span></mouse>
					<<if _bet gt 100>>HALLO!<</if>>
				</td>
			</tr>
			<<if $dice.shooter isnot 0 and $dice.positions[0] is "">>
				<tr>
					<th class="gold">Betting position:</th>
					<td>
						<<if $dice.queue[1] isnot 0>>
							<<listbox "_position">>
								<<option "In Favour">>
								<<option "Against">>
							<</listbox>>
						<<else>>
							<<listbox "_position">>
								<<option "Against">>
							<</listbox>>
							You must bet against the shooter.
						<</if>>
					</td>
				</tr>
			<</if>>
			</tbody>
		</table>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-instructions">>
		<<foldout false "_diceInstructionsFoldout">>
			<span class="gold">Game Instructions</span>
			<ul>
				<li>All players must pay an ante upfront to play a round.</li>
				<li>Each round consists of the following stages:</li>
				<ul>
					<li>The Bet. In which players decide whether they'll bet with or against the shooter</li>
					<li>The "Come Out" roll. Which is the first roll, that may decide "the point" for subsequent rolls.</li>
					<li>The Subsequent rolls. The rolls that follow, until the shooter rolls a 7 or "the point".</li>
				</ul>
				<li>The "shooter" is the player currently rolling the dice. And they always make the first bet.</li>
				<li>The player to the right of the shooter must always bet 'Against'.</li>
				<li>On the first roll of their turn, 
				<ul>
					<li>If the shooter rolls 7 or 11, then the shooter along with those who bet in favour win and divide the pot.</li>
					<li>If the shooter rolls 2, 3, or 12, the shooter loses, and those who bet against divide the pot.</li>
					<li>If the shooter rolls anything else, that number becomes "the point".</li>
				</ul>
				<li>On subsequent rolls of their turn,</li>
				<ul>
					<li>If the shooter rolls "the point", then the shooter along with those who bet in favour win and divide the pot.</li>
					<li>If the shooter rolls 7, the shooter loses, and those who bet against divide the pot.</li>
					<li>Otherwise, the shooter keeps rolling until "the point" or 7 come out.</li>
				</ul>
				<li>If the shooter wins or loses, the dice pass to the next player who now becomes the new shooter.</li>
		<</foldout>>
		<br>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-roll">>
		<<set $dice.values to []>>
		<<rng 1 6>><<set $dice.values.push($rng)>>
		<<rng 1 6>><<set $dice.values.push($rng)>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-clear">>
		<<set $dice.values to undefined>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-compute-result">>
		<<set _rollResult to $dice.values[0] + $dice.values[1]>>

		<<if $dice.round.point is undefined>> /* Come Out result */
			<<if [7,11].includes(_rollResult)>>
				<<set $dice.round.result to "In Favour">>
			<<elseif [2,3,12].includes(_rollResult)>>
				<<set $dice.round.result to "Against">>
			<<else>>
				<<set $dice.round.point to _rollResult>>
			<</if>>
		
		<<else>> /* Subsequent rolls result */
			<<if _rollResult is $dice.round.point>>	
				<<set $dice.round.result to "In Favour">>
			<<elseif _rollResult is 7>>
				<<set $dice.round.result to "Against">>
			<</if>>

		<</if>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-compute-wagers">>
		<<set _raisedBet to _args[0]>>
		<<for _i, _player range $dice.queue>>
			<<capture _player>>
				<<if _player is 0>>
					<<continue>> /* Skip betting in PC's name */
				<</if>>

				<<if _raisedBet and _player isnot 0>> /* If PC raised the bet, match it */
					<<dice-bet _player `$dice.bets[0] - $dice.bets[_player]`>>
					<<run $dice.log.push("The <<person"+_player+">><<person>> matches the bet.")>>

				<<elseif _player is $dice.shooter and $dice.shooter isnot 0>> /* If shooter is not PC, wager between 10 and 80 */
					<<set _wagerScale to [500,1000,3000][$dice.wagerLvl]>>
					<<set _wagerAmount to random(1,8)*_wagerScale>>
					<<dice-bet _player _wagerAmount>>
					<<run $dice.log.push("The <<person"+_player+">><<person>> raises the stake by <<printmoney "+_wagerAmount+">>.")>>

				<<elseif _player isnot 0>>/* If current betting player is not PC */
					
					/* Match the bet */
					<<set _raiseAmount to $dice.bets[$dice.shooter] - $dice.bets[_player]>>
					<<dice-bet _player _raiseAmount>> 
					
					/* Force at least one 'Against' position */
					<<set $dice.positions[_player] to _i is 1 or random(0,1)? "Against" : "In Favour">> 

					/* Queue up the log message */
					<<if _raiseAmount gt 0>>
						<<run $dice.log.push("The <<person"+_player+">><<person>> matches the bet.")>>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
			<</capture>>
		<</for>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-bet">>
		<<set _player to _args[0]>> /* Index of player */
		<<set _amount to _args[1]>> /* Amount to bet */
		
		/* Bet whatever remains if can't match the bet */
		<<if $dice.money[_player] lte _amount>><<set _amount to $dice.money[_player]>><</if>>

		<<set $dice.money[_player] -= _amount>>
		<<set $dice.bets[_player] += _amount>>
		<<set $dice.pot += _amount>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-endround">>
		/* Count winners */
		<<set _winnerCount to $dice.round.result is "In Favour"? 1 : 0>>
		<<for _player range [0,1,2,3]>>
			<<set $dice.bets[_player] to 0>>
			<<set _winnerCount += $dice.positions[_player] is $dice.round.result? 1 : 0>>
		<</for>>
		
		/* Split the pot among winners */
		<<set _split to $dice.pot / _winnerCount>><<set $dice.pot to 0>>
		<<if $dice.round.result is "In Favour">>
			<<set $dice.money[$dice.shooter] += _split>>
			<<set $dice.event.roundLoss[$dice.shooter] to 0>>
			<<capture _split>>
				<<set _gains to _split - $dice.bets[$dice.shooter]>>
				<<if $dice.shooter is 0>>
					<<run $dice.log.push("You won <<printmoney "+_gains+">>.")>>
				<<else>>
					<<run $dice.log.push("The <<person"+$dice.shooter+">><<person>> won <<printmoney "+_gains+">>.")>>
				<</if>>
			<</capture>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $dice.event.roundLoss[$dice.shooter] to 1>>
		<</if>>
		<<for _player range [0,1,2,3]>>
			<<if $dice.positions[_player] is $dice.round.result>>
				<<set $dice.money[_player] += _split>>
				<<set $dice.event.roundLoss[_player] to 0>>
				<<capture _player, _split>>
					<<set _gains to _split - $dice.bets[_player]>>
					<<if _player is 0>>
						<<run $dice.log.push("You won <<printmoney "+_gains+">>.")>>
					<<else>>
						<<run $dice.log.push("The <<person"+_player+">><<person>> won <<printmoney "+_gains+">>.")>>
					<</if>>
				<</capture>>
			<<else>>
				<<set $dice.event.roundLoss[_player] to 1>>
			<</if>>
		<</for>>

		/* Tick or Trigger drinks event */
		<<if $dice.event.drinkEnabled>>
			<<set $dice.event.pending to 1>>
		<<elseif $dice.event.roundsUntilAlcohol lte 0 and $dice.event.drinkIntro lt 1>>
			<<set $dice.event.drinkIntro to 1>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $dice.event.roundsUntilAlcohol-->>
		<</if>>

		/* Clean up round variables */
		<<set $dice.round.result to undefined>>
		<<set $dice.round.point to undefined>>
		<<set $dice.bets to [0,0,0,0]>>
		<<set $dice.positions to ["","","",""]>>
		<<set $dice.values to undefined>>

		/* Prepare the next round */
		<<set $phase to 1>>
		<<run $dice.queue.shift()>>
		<<run $dice.queue.pushUnique($dice.shooter)>>
		<<set $dice.shooter to $dice.queue.first()>>
		<<set $dice.positions[$dice.shooter] to "Shooter">>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-endgame">>
		<<set $money += $dice.money[0]>>
		<<unset $dice>>
		<<endevent>>
	<</widget>>

:: Pub Dice Minigame
	<<effects>>

	<<if $diceintro>>
		<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>>
		
		<<set _playerMoney to [50000,100000,300000]>>
		<<set _playerMoney to _playerMoney[$wagerLvl]>>
		<<set $dice to {
			wagerLvl: $wagerLvl,
			pot: 0,
			players: [$player, $NPCList[0], $NPCList[1], $NPCList[2]], /* Indexing players */
			shooter: 0, /* Index of player that's currently the shooter */
			values: undefined, /* Houses the results of the two dice. */
			queue: [0,1,2,3], /* The shooter queue, using player indices. The first one is always the shooter */
			money: [_playerMoney,_playerMoney,_playerMoney,_playerMoney], 
			positions: ["Shooter", "", "", ""],
			bets: [0,0,0,0],
			round: {
				point: undefined,
				result: undefined,
			},
			log: [],
			event: {
				pending: 0,
				roundLoss: [0,0,0,0],
				roundsUntilAlcohol: random(2,4),
				drinkIntro: 0,
				drinkEnabled: 0,
			}
		}>>
		<<unset $diceintro>>
		<<unset $wagerLvl>>
	<</if>>


	<<switch $phase>>
	<<case 1>> /* Opening Bets */

		<<dice-log>>
		<<dice-events>>

		<<if !$dice.event.pending>>
			<<dice-display>>

			<<link [[Play this round (£20)|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>><<set $dicewagerintro to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Stop|Pub]]>><<endevent>><<dice-endgame>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>

	<<case 2>> /* Roll Results (Win / Lose - Point Discovery) */

		<<dice-compute-result>>
		<<dice-log>>
		<<dice-display>>

		<<if $dice.round.result>>
			<<link [[Next round|Pub Dice Minigame]]>><<dice-endround>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Next|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>><<dice-clear>><<set $wagerstage to 3>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>

	<</switch>>

	<br>
	<<if !$dice.event.pending>>
		<<dice-instructions>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $dice.event.pending to 0>>

:: Pub Dice Minigame Wager

	/* Initialization */
	<<if $dicewagerintro>> 
		<<for _player range [0,1,2,3]>>
			<<dice-bet _player 2000>>
			<<capture _player>>
				<<if _player isnot 0>>
					<<run $dice.log.push("The <<person"+_player+">><<person>> joins this round.")>>
				<</if>>
			<</capture>>
		<</for>>
		<<unset $dicewagerintro>>
		<<set $wagerstage to 1>>
	<</if>>

	<<if $wagerstage is 1>> /* Initial Bet - Shooter bets first */
		
		<<if $dice.shooter isnot 0>>
			<<dice-compute-wagers>>
		<</if>>

		<<dice-log>>
		<<dice-display>>
		
		<<if $dice.shooter is 0>>
			<<dice-betting-interface>>

			<<link [[Wager (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
				<<set $wagerstage to 2>>
				<<set $phase to 2>>
				<<set _pcIndex to 0>>
				<<dice-bet _pcIndex `_bet * 100`>>
				<<dice-compute-wagers>>
				<<pass 2>>
			<</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			
			<<dice-betting-interface>>
			
			<<link [[Wager (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
				<<set $wagerstage to 2>>
				<<set $phase to 2>>
				<<set _pcIndex to 0>>
				<<dice-bet _pcIndex `$dice.bets[$dice.shooter] - $dice.bets[_pcIndex] + _bet * 100`>>
				<<set $dice.positions[_pcIndex] to _position>>
				<<if _bet gt 0>><<dice-compute-wagers "raise">><</if>>
				<<pass 2>>
			<</link>>
			<br>
			/* Here I can add options to wager other things besides money */
		<</if>>

	<<elseif $wagerstage is 2>> /* Confirmation of Pot / NPCs match current bet */

		<<dice-log>>
		Now that all bets are in...<br>

		<<dice-display>>
		<br>

		<<if $dice.shooter is 0>>
			<<link [[Roll (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>>
				<<dice-roll>><<pass 2>>
			<</link>>
		<<else>>
			The shooter's about to roll.
			<br>
			<<link [[Next (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>>
				<<dice-roll>><<pass 2>>
			<</link>>
		<</if>>
		<br>

	<<elseif $wagerstage is 3>> /* Raise the stakes after first roll? */

		<<dice-log>>
		Everyone's eyes are intensely focused on <<= $dice.shooter is 0? "you": "the shooter">>. Watching each and every move.<br>
		
		<<dice-display>>
		<<dice-betting-interface>>

		<<if $dice.shooter is 0>>
			<<link [[Roll (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>>
				<<dice-roll>><<pass 2>>
			<</link>>
		<<else>>
			The shooter's about to roll.
			<br>
			<<link [[Next (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>>
				<<dice-roll>><<pass 2>>
			<</link>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
		
		<<link [[Up the stakes (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
			<<set $wagerstage to 2>>
			<<set $phase to 2>>
			<<set _pcIndex to 0>>
			<<dice-bet _pcIndex `_bet * 100`>>
			<<if _bet gt 0>><<dice-compute-wagers "raise">><</if>>
			<<pass 2>>
		<</link>>
		<br>
		/* Here I can add options to wager other things besides money */


	<<else>>
		THIS IS A BUG. YOU SHOULDN'T BE HERE. PLEASE, REPORT THIS.
		<<run console.error(`Betting Stage: {$wagerstage}`)>>
	<</if>>
	<br>

	<<dice-instructions>>
